ligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[273,281,283],{"id":282},"core-components","Core Components",[285,286,287,295,300,306],"ul",{},[288,289,290,294],"li",{},[291,292,293],"strong",{},"Kinotic Apps"," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[288,296,297,299],{},[291,298,170],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[288,301,302,305],{},[291,303,304],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[288,307,308,311],{},[291,309,310],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[273,313,315],{"id":314},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[317,318,319,335],"table",{},[320,321,322],"thead",{},[323,324,325,329,332],"tr",{},[326,327,328],"th",{},"Concern",[326,330,331],{},"Without Kinotic",[326,333,334],{},"With Kinotic",[336,337,338,350,365,376,387],"tbody",{},[323,339,340,344,347],{},[341,342,343],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[341,345,346],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[341,348,349],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[323,351,352,354,357],{},[341,353,88],{},[341,355,356],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[341,358,359,360,364],{},"Define entities, run ",[361,362,363],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[323,366,367,370,373],{},[341,368,369],{},"Service Mesh",[341,371,372],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[341,374,375],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[323,377,378,381,384],{},[341,379,380],{},"CI\u002FCD",[341,382,383],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[341,385,386],{},"Handled by the platform",[323,388,389,391,394],{},[341,390,207],{},[341,392,393],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[341,395,396],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[269,398,399,402],{},[291,400,401],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[269,404,405,408],{},[291,406,407],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[269,410,411,414],{},[291,412,413],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[273,416,418],{"id":417},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[269,420,421],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[423,424,425,430,436,441,446,451],"ol",{},[288,426,427,429],{},[291,428,15],{}," -- Run Kinotic on your machine and build your first app with Claude Code.",[288,431,432,435],{},[291,433,434],{},"Application Structure"," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[288,437,438,440],{},[291,439,63],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[288,442,443,445],{},[291,444,88],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[288,447,448,450],{},[291,449,121],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[288,452,453,455],{},[291,454,130],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[269,457,458,459,462],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[460,461,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":464,"searchDepth":465,"depth":465,"links":466},"",2,[467,468,469,470],{"id":275,"depth":465,"text":276},{"id":282,"depth":465,"text":283},{"id":314,"depth":465,"text":315},{"id":417,"depth":465,"text":418},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":471},"KpL0zILscU1MLkU-cxbQcYvdUFNYvlRGMzTjCuoMizk",[473,479],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":480,"children":-1},"Run Kinotic on your own machine, create your organization, and build your first app with Claude Code.",1794530292577]